  "change": "Single behavioral change from v1: empty FFmpeg input-slot branch polls broker at timeout=0 instead of 20 ms. This removes per-frame waiting after caller drains available output; pending compressed-AU backpressure still waits internally and EOS still drains with bounded waits.",
  "api_contract": "The input slot is empty when this EAGAIN is returned, so a subsequent avcodec_send_packet can accept new input. Pending-AU backpressure must not return this EAGAIN and retains its bounded internal loop.",
